{
    "version": "10.0.14393.795",
    "description": "Windows 10 SDK 周年更新版（build 14393.795）。独立安装器，配合 VS2015 使用。",
    "homepage": "https://developer.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/downloads/sdk-archive/",
    "license": {
        "identifier": "Freeware",
        "url": "https://developer.microsoft.com/windows/sdk-license/"
    },
    "notes": [
        "【版本锁定说明】",
        "本 manifest 已锁定到 10.0.14393.795，无 autoupdate、无 checkver。",
        "即使本仓库后续推送其他 SDK 版本 manifest（例如 windows10sdk-17763 等），",
        "本 manifest 文件不会被改动，始终可以安装到 14393.795。这是参照官方 versions 仓库的版本锁定模式。",
        "",
        "【安装路径】",
        "安装到系统目录：'C:\\Program Files (x86)\\Windows Kits\\10'。",
        "已选中的功能：",
        "  - Windows SDK for Desktop C++ x86 Apps",
        "  - Windows SDK for Desktop C++ amd64 Apps",
        "  - Debugging Tools for Windows",
        "  - Windows SDK Documentation",
        "",
        "【URL 提示】",
        "微软偶尔会重新整理独立 SDK 归档的 URL。如果下方 URL 返回 404，请到以下页面验证最新地址：",
        "  https://developer.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/downloads/sdk-archive/",
        "如有必要，镜像到你自己的 GitHub Release 使用。",
        "",
        "【Hash 提示】",
        "本 manifest 故意省略 hash 字段。计算方法：",
        "  Get-FileHash standalonesdk.exe -Algorithm SHA256",
        "或者安装时跳过校验：",
        "  scoop install cikaros/windows10sdk-14393 --skip"
    ],
    "url": "https://download.microsoft.com/download/9/0/E/90E83EF9-A5F3-4C1E-9198-7D7EDE5F9D9C/standalonesdk.exe",
    "installer": {
        "args": [
            "/quiet",
            "/norestart",
            "/features",
            "OptionId.WindowsDesktopDebugging,OptionId.WindowsDesktopSoftwareDevelopment,OptionId.WindowsSoftwareDevelopmentKit,OptionId.WindowsSoftwareDevelopmentKitMSITools"
        ]
    },
    "post_install": [
        "Remove-Item -Path \"$dir\\$fname\" -Force -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue"
    ],
    "env_set": {
        "WindowsSdkDir": "C:\\Program Files (x86)\\Windows Kits\\10\\",
        "WindowsSDKVersion": "10.0.14393.0"
    }
}
